# Probe autophasing with the current loop's decoupling on (conf0.cur_ind):
# the angle it finds is the rotor's. The rotor starts at 0.3 rad (1.5 rad
# electrical, 5 pole pairs) and the encoder counts from 0 at boot.
# Before 2026-10-19 vel2 followed the field turns between the probe pulses
# (up to ~94 rad/s with the rotor still) and cur_ind fed that speed forward
# as q current, up to 0.15 A against a 0.125 A pulse: the estimate was
# ~11.5 deg off (com_fb 1.70). pid.txt now runs vel2 only once phased
# (vel2.en = fault0.en_pid). DEBUGNOTES "Probe phasing ~11 deg off".
@args --drive ../hwtest/burnin/ECMA-C30604FS/stmbl.conf
@timeout 60
conf0.cur_ind = 1
enc_fb0.sim_boot_zero = 1
hv0.sim_upos = 0.3
hv0.sim_pos = 0.3
debug_level 0
lcnc 0 0
run 0.5
lcnc 1 0
run 3
fault0.state
fb_switch0.com_fb
hv0.sim_pos
@expect fault0.state == 1
@expect hv0.sim_pos ~ 0.3 0.002
@expect fb_switch0.com_fb ~ 1.5 0.035
